{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360337-how-does-coaxing-the-spirits-work","id":1360337,"title":"How does Coaxing the Spirits work?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-11T09:55:18-08:00","id":1360337,"title":"How does Coaxing the Spirits work?","content":"Okay, hear me out. How does the Coaxing the Spirits work? It's simple to understand how does it work on the spirit. You compel spirit to act according to it's nature; that's easy. What I don't understand is how does compelling the physical representation of an object work. Spirits on the other side of the Shadow can affect their material counterparts, but that's not easy and requires Reaching Manifestation. I guess you could compel spirit to act out with it's Influences and Numinas, but it's not really clear if that would work on mote, Rank 0 spirit without any special powers. And usefulness of Coaxing the Spirits is really low if you exclude Rank 0 spirits. Besides, Coaxing the Spirits isn't penalized by the Gauntlet Strength, implying that it works on the object directly. But how would that work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","name":"Dark Archon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11880_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-11T10:22:56-08:00","id":1360346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dark Archon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360337-how-does-coaxing-the-spirits-work#post1360337\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But how would that work?</div> </div> </div> </div>Magic.<br /> <br /> I'm not (just) being snarky, here. Based on the established rules governing ephemeral entities and what we know of the effort involved for Spirits to take action in the physical world, the spell shouldn't really work the way that it does. One can only presume that it interacts with systems that we aren't privy to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-11T10:42:58-08:00","id":1360351,"title":"","content":"I\u2019ve seen this explained better elsewhere, but I\u2019ll give it a shot.<br /> <br /> Spirits only become distinct from the thing they are as they grow. The spirit of a pen is also the pen itself. Eventually it might gain full sentience and expand its purview to move on from the pen, but for now it\u2019s here being a pen. And Coaxing the Spirit is just telling the pen to click the nib out by getting in touch with the part of it the Spirit arcanum can touch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}